<v John Connors>No, I don't want to say it any louder. I don't want to say it any louder. No, I don't want to say it. It's OK. I've said it.

00:58:12.430 --> 00:58:16.510
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:16.510 --> 00:58:18.820
